# cultivation — soil_fertilized: the active-Fertilizer-dose overlay, rendered by mod
# code as a translucent flat quad on vanilla farmland's top face. A sparse scatter of
# small 1-2px dark compost specks in earthy near-black brown, ~90% transparent, so it
# reads as fresh amendment worked into the soil and composes on top of the crack
# overlays. Specks stay off the outermost edge rows/columns so the quad tiles across
# adjacent blocks without doubling density at the seam. Code-bound (not on the block
# atlas), so no outline and no margin.
size: 16

legend:
  . transparent
  c #3A2C1CB4   # compost brown (~70% alpha)
  e #241A0FB4   # dark compost core
  f #4E3A24A6   # lighter compost fleck

grid:
  ................
  ................
  ...ce........f..
  ..........cc....
  ......ff...f....
  ............c...
  ..cc............
  ........ecc.....
  ................
  .....c.....ff...
  ...ce...........
  .............c..
  .......ecc......
  ..........ce....
  ................
  ................
